        <head>COMPARE PRICKS.</head>
        <p>COMPARE PRICKS.</p>
        <p>REVOLUTION IN THE FURNISHING TRADE. Mr. GERSHON is a great admirer of keen competi- tion, but he strongly obje,ts to others copying his advertise- ments. It's mein ; and to tho,w that have not the brain power to write their own, Mr. Gershon will do so for them.</p>
        <p>REVOLUTION IN THU FURNISHING TRADE. No extra charge or credit, and 5 per cent. allowed for prompt cash. Mr. biershon is anxiously waiting to see what unscrupulous shopliedper will copy this.</p>
