        <p>When in search of genuine I,econd-I and goods don't be de- ceived and have new common stuff, m re like orange boxes, palmed on to tou. When I have second hAnd furniture I give he names and addresses, and d• n't simply say I get them from this place and th tt place, You might as well look for a neeule in a truss ot hay as look for the iateowner. Don't forget what the popular author wrote, "All men are liars."</p>
