        <p>FIVE PER CHM. ALLOWED FOR PROM.Pi CASH. Out of the number. of mansions, hotels. and houses I have second-hand goods from, the followiog nay be mentioned. CALL AND INSPECT THE GOODS FROM— HAYESLEIGH, OLD TRAFORD PRINCE OF WALES HOTEL, HARROGATE. HOLLY LODUE, ALEXANDRA PARK. FULSHAW BANK, W I LM•sLOW. CARLTON-STREET, MO: S MRS. GOLLOTT, WI LM - LOW. • MRS, THOI(BURN, UPPER BROOK-STREET. AND OTHERS.</p>
        <p>BARGAINS GREAT AND WONDERFUL. Smart complete House of Furniture. consisting of the whole furniture for three rooms, sitting-room, bedroom, full size bed b tead. mat' ress bed,boister, pillows, sheets, blankets, bolster ease, ryllow slips, and kitehon complete. all like new; price 14 guineas. No extra charge on. the deferred payment system. Fivs per cent. for prompt cash. Call and inspect them. No harm done if you don't buy. MARE VLLOUS VALUE. A Charming House of Furniture, really like new. It consists of dining-room suite in leather, extending dining- table, carpet, rug, fender, fire brasses, lace curtains, window pole complete, magnificent bedroom suite (not paiuttd. solid wood), enclosed dressing-table, large bevelled glass attached ; enclosed 14 ashatar,d, marble slab tile back, and bevelled shaving mirror, they form two complete chest, of drawers ; full-size handsome b!aca and brass bed: tead. wire spring mattress, bed. Meer. pillows, sheets. blankets, pillow slips, bolster cases, toilet set, carpet, coinpletefurniture for kitchen, flooreloth for same, dit'o for lobty and stairs. Call and inspect the lot. Get a complete list, and you will say they are a marvel of cheapness for 23 guineas. No extra charge on the deferred I ayment system. Five per cent allowed for prompt cash.</p>
